      "comment": "ZIPPING KESTREL (4) goes very well at the course and distance with three wins and a placing from five starts. Scored by one length last time (17.69) in a Grade 5 over 300m at this track. Makes strong appeal on best. OCEAN VIBE (1) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fifth (17.89) at this track in a Grade 5. Good beginner and aided by the inside draw. Well placed here and can atone this time. POWER ROLEX (7) comes here off a placing in good time (17.28) over 300m at this track when beaten 4.5 lengths in a Grade 5. This is tougher but expected to be in the finish. JIMMY AND ME (5) won as punters' elect last time and another big run is on the cards.",
